(4310440, 621280, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the qualities of the shot quite a bit.  Very attractive girl, and she looks genuinely sad and everything.  The only thing that strikes me as being kinda weird is that she''s grieving at a tomb of someone she could have never known, considering it''s from the 1800s.  It would have probably had a better, more credible impact if it was a more recent stone.</td>', 'I like the qualities of the shot quite a bit.  Very attractive girl, and she looks genuinely sad and everything.  The only thing that strikes me as being kinda weird is that she''s grieving at a tomb of someone she could have never known, considering it''s from the 1800s.  It would have probably had a better, more credible impact if it was a more recent stone.', '2007-12-12 09:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
