(4316003, 621053, 51031, '<td valign="top">Beautiful yet eerie shot.  I love it</td>', 'Beautiful yet eerie shot.  I love it', '2007-12-15 13:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316029, 621280, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, but the execution doesn''t work for me. Why? Three main reasons: 1. the young woman is at LEAST a couple generations removed from the putative ancestors under the stone, so I ask myself "How can they really be loved ones?" 2. The pose, especially the exposed leg, seems more provocative than anything else, though I admit it''s not all that provocative. 3. The facial expression does not say anything to me about sorrow or loss. It is curiously neutral, and if it says anything to me at all, it''s a sort of baby "come hither" look.<br/> <br/>So the concept, and how you did the posing, seem at odds with each other. It''s nicely lit and well done, technically.</td>', 'I like the concept here, but the execution doesn''t work for me. Why? Three main reasons: 1. the young woman is at LEAST a couple generations removed from the putative ancestors under the stone, so I ask myself "How can they really be loved ones?" 2. The pose, especially the exposed leg, seems more provocative than anything else, though I admit it''s not all that provocative. 3. The facial expression does not say anything to me about sorrow or loss. It is curiously neutral, and if it says anything to me at all, it''s a sort of baby "come hither" look. So the concept, and how you did the posing, seem at odds with each other. It''s nicely lit and well done, technically.', '2007-12-15 13:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316032, 620083, 30861, '<td valign="top">Fantastic subjects, but the image is all subject and little execution, IMO. It looks like an everyday catalogue photo.</td>', 'Fantastic subjects, but the image is all subject and little execution, IMO. It looks like an everyday catalogue photo.', '2007-12-15 13:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
