(4319747, 621721, 87748, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more stuff seems to pop out.  Putting the interpretation into the psychology of the viewer is a good way to exploit "hell," and the title tops that off.  Good idea.</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more stuff seems to pop out.  Putting the interpretation into the psychology of the viewer is a good way to exploit "hell," and the title tops that off.  Good idea.', '2007-12-18 01:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319754, 621283, 87748, '<td valign="top">Very raw and doesn''t leave much to interpretation - it''s very blunt.  But it does bring hell to Earth.</td>', 'Very raw and doesn''t leave much to interpretation - it''s very blunt.  But it does bring hell to Earth.', '2007-12-18 01:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319770, 621413, 87502, '<td valign="top">what is hell about this?</td>', 'what is hell about this?', '2007-12-18 01:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319772, 621717, 87748, '<td valign="top">Great scene and the water has an eerie hellish feel to it.  Darks are very dark, but it works for the effect.  Steeple/pinnacle in the background is a good touch.</td>', 'Great scene and the water has an eerie hellish feel to it.  Darks are very dark, but it works for the effect.  Steeple/pinnacle in the background is a good touch.', '2007-12-18 01:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319777, 621325, 87748, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this that gives me the chills... the color, or the contrast, I''m not sure.  But the face definitely is composed perfectly for the effect, and the lantern fits right in.  Nice use of light ... or dark, not sure.</td>', 'There''s something about this that gives me the chills... the color, or the contrast, I''m not sure.  But the face definitely is composed perfectly for the effect, and the lantern fits right in.  Nice use of light ... or dark, not sure.', '2007-12-18 01:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319778, 621625, 87748, '<td valign="top">A frozen, cold hell.  Not much to this composition, but the trees add some hellish feelingot it, and the dead stream adds to that effect.  Bleak and contrasty, but used wisely.</td>', 'A frozen, cold hell.  Not much to this composition, but the trees add some hellish feelingot it, and the dead stream adds to that effect.  Bleak and contrasty, but used wisely.', '2007-12-18 01:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319779, 620867, 87748, '<td valign="top">A scene which work well with the challenge in my opinion.  Not very gory and not too bland; it gives a good dose of "hell" in a concrete sense.  Good composition.</td>', 'A scene which work well with the challenge in my opinion.  Not very gory and not too bland; it gives a good dose of "hell" in a concrete sense.  Good composition.', '2007-12-18 01:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319780, 620624, 87748, '<td valign="top">Wow, outstanding.  I can''t tell top from bottom, and that confusion paired with the title and color make it an interesting composition.  Seems like it is probably something pretty ordinary, though, but the effect is pretty good.</td>', 'Wow, outstanding.  I can''t tell top from bottom, and that confusion paired with the title and color make it an interesting composition.  Seems like it is probably something pretty ordinary, though, but the effect is pretty good.', '2007-12-18 01:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319782, 620363, 87748, '<td valign="top">Pretty amazing depiction; it looks like lava in the sky.  The blue gives some nice contrast against the deep orange.  Landscape is a nice touch and doesn''t distract from the sky too much.  The cloud texture at the very bottom looks a little too peaceful (like a beach sunset) but it''s not too bad. Very nice overall.</td>', 'Pretty amazing depiction; it looks like lava in the sky.  The blue gives some nice contrast against the deep orange.  Landscape is a nice touch and doesn''t distract from the sky too much.  The cloud texture at the very bottom looks a little too peaceful (like a beach sunset) but it''s not too bad. Very nice overall.', '2007-12-18 01:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319785, 621430, 87748, '<td valign="top">Pretty good effect here.  It almost seems like the surface is burning.  Open to interpretation, which is good, but lacks a human effect.</td>', 'Pretty good effect here.  It almost seems like the surface is burning.  Open to interpretation, which is good, but lacks a human effect.', '2007-12-18 01:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319786, 621641, 87748, '<td valign="top">This one is pretty creepy.  The expression on the skull is great.  Nice use of color and texture here.</td>', 'This one is pretty creepy.  The expression on the skull is great.  Nice use of color and texture here.', '2007-12-18 01:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319788, 621357, 87748, '<td valign="top">Brings a strong meaning for me.  Pretty simple but makes a statement.</td>', 'Brings a strong meaning for me.  Pretty simple but makes a statement.', '2007-12-18 01:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319791, 621368, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice color, reflections, and a human effect here.  Doesn''t really give rise to any feelings of "hell" for  me, but a good composition nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice color, reflections, and a human effect here.  Doesn''t really give rise to any feelings of "hell" for  me, but a good composition nonetheless.', '2007-12-18 01:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319795, 621458, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white.  Shower in the distance is a good catch.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white.  Shower in the distance is a good catch.', '2007-12-18 01:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319801, 620682, 87748, '<td valign="top">I like how some interpretations of hell are more concrete and "ordinary," if you can call it that.  The dog pulls this image away from any possible cliche, as it really makes you realize there is a living element to a lot of hell.  Depth and texture in the image don''t distract from the subject here, but add effect and emphasis.  Very good!</td>', 'I like how some interpretations of hell are more concrete and "ordinary," if you can call it that.  The dog pulls this image away from any possible cliche, as it really makes you realize there is a living element to a lot of hell.  Depth and texture in the image don''t distract from the subject here, but add effect and emphasis.  Very good!', '2007-12-18 01:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319805, 621640, 87748, '<td valign="top">Feels like hell in the foreground, and the stock exchange building adds another dimension to "hell."  Great rawness and the bare trees add greatly to the effect.  This is a mix of two human elements (and many subelements thereof) that clash, in a good way.  It''s almost like life doesn''t give respect to death.</td>', 'Feels like hell in the foreground, and the stock exchange building adds another dimension to "hell."  Great rawness and the bare trees add greatly to the effect.  This is a mix of two human elements (and many subelements thereof) that clash, in a good way.  It''s almost like life doesn''t give respect to death.', '2007-12-18 01:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319922, 620619, 66201, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough: I find myself coming back to this one - if I look at it with DPC eyes, I bypass it and think "ugh another 4 shots"...but then if I think of myself walking through a gallery with all these images oyunted beautifully on the walls and carrying a brochure of the exhibition entitled "Hell"... I would say that this would be really arresting and disturbing and haunting...it would make me shudder... so I''m going to vote with my artistic soul here and not with DPC conditioning.. and give this a 9.</td>', 'Strangely enough: I find myself coming back to this one - if I look at it with DPC eyes, I bypass it and think "ugh another 4 shots"...but then if I think of myself walking through a gallery with all these images oyunted beautifully on the walls and carrying a brochure of the exhibition entitled "Hell"... I would say that this would be really arresting and disturbing and haunting...it would make me shudder... so I''m going to vote with my artistic soul here and not with DPC conditioning.. and give this a 9.', '2007-12-18 07:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319923, 620363, 66201, '<td valign="top">ahhh- too beautiful for a concept of "hell": yes I get the firey sky, but it just looks like a beautiful sunset/sunrise that one would drive out of the city just to look upon.</td>', 'ahhh- too beautiful for a concept of "hell": yes I get the firey sky, but it just looks like a beautiful sunset/sunrise that one would drive out of the city just to look upon.', '2007-12-18 07:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
