(4322503, 620018, 70128, '<td valign="top">Well, while it''s true and I admit this is basically a collage, I also added (maybe not so noticeable) a Rosary on top of it. Without the Rosary, the picture and title would have not made much sense. But I understand and accept the comments about this being a collage.<br/> <br/>This photograph also let me know where the World stands, with still so many people believing in War (even when they are non-sense, unless it''s oil) as a way to reach Peace. You don''t find Peace by "legally" killing people "under God''s name". It''s still KILLING.</td>', 'Well, while it''s true and I admit this is basically a collage, I also added (maybe not so noticeable) a Rosary on top of it. Without the Rosary, the picture and title would have not made much sense. But I understand and accept the comments about this being a collage. This photograph also let me know where the World stands, with still so many people believing in War (even when they are non-sense, unless it''s oil) as a way to reach Peace. You don''t find Peace by "legally" killing people "under God''s name". It''s still KILLING.', '2007-12-19 08:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
