(4322879, 621610, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, Jon!  This IS Hell for me. . . I don''t have exactly the same "rush hour" experience I don''t guess as you. . .but trust me. . I swear I am in Hell on my way home most days!    And there have been days, I would have sold my SOUL to escape. . .juuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuust kidding.   I wouldn''t sell my soul for anything. . . .but. . . .you know what I mean.   This is a great Hell concept!    I wish it got rated higher!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, Jon!  This IS Hell for me. . . I don''t have exactly the same "rush hour" experience I don''t guess as you. . .but trust me. . I swear I am in Hell on my way home most days!    And there have been days, I would have sold my SOUL to escape. . .juuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuust kidding.   I wouldn''t sell my soul for anything. . . .but. . . .you know what I mean.   This is a great Hell concept!    I wish it got rated higher! ', '2007-12-19 10:47:08.000000', NULL, 0),
