(4323443, 621280, 49460, '<td valign="top">Wow thanks for the votes and the comments. <br/> <br/>Here are some alternates from the same shoot that maybe I should have used:<br/><a href="//www.razzberrymedia.com/blog/portraits/images/DSC_1043.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Another Take</a> <br/>or<br/><a href="//www.razzberrymedia.com/blog/portraits/images/DSC_1074.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Another Take Two</a> <br/> <br/>Not that it matters at this point, but I thought it might be worth mentioning... There were a few valid comments about the model looking too young for the tombstone. I guess what I was thinking but didn''t convey well was the idea that she was living forever (not aging) and the people she loved were dying around her normally. She was *much* older than she looked while living out her eternity. <br/> <br/>Not sure what to say about the pose. Except that we thought it would be more interesting to have her hugging the stone rather than kneeling at it. Which has been done to death. No pun intended.<br/> <br/>All I can do is try again and hope I do better next time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-19 14:07:42.</i></td>', 'Wow thanks for the votes and the comments.  Here are some alternates from the same shoot that maybe I should have used:Another Take orAnother Take Two  Not that it matters at this point, but I thought it might be worth mentioning... There were a few valid comments about the model looking too young for the tombstone. I guess what I was thinking but didn''t convey well was the idea that she was living forever (not aging) and the people she loved were dying around her normally. She was *much* older than she looked while living out her eternity.  Not sure what to say about the pose. Except that we thought it would be more interesting to have her hugging the stone rather than kneeling at it. Which has been done to death. No pun intended. All I can do is try again and hope I do better next time.', '2007-12-19 13:32:08.000000', '2007-12-19 14:07:42.000000', 0),
(4323477, 621711, 38706, '<td valign="top">LOL... The first prob is you look to be using Lotus Notes :-)  I would certainly skip the MIL given the 4pm but geese 2hrs for the 9am is too much :-)</td>', 'LOL... The first prob is you look to be using Lotus Notes :-)  I would certainly skip the MIL given the 4pm but geese 2hrs for the 9am is too much :-)', '2007-12-19 13:42:44.000000', NULL, 0),
